---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | GovLink" pathname="/about">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mobile:py-12">
    <h1 class="type-site-hero text-center mb-8">About GovLink</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-secondary">
        GovLink is a unified gateway to United States government services and information.
        We bring together 29,000 federal websites into one searchable, trustworthy interface.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        To make government services accessible, understandable, and trustworthy for everyone.
        We believe that finding help from your government should be as easy as asking a question.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Privacy First</h2>
      <p>
        GovLink does not track you, show ads, or sell your data. Your questions stay between
        you and the government agencies that answer them. We use no cookies for analytics
        or advertising.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Official Sources Only</h2>
      <p>
        Every answer cites its source — a .gov website, an official form, or a published
        regulation. You always know exactly where information comes from.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Built by the National Design Studio</h2>
      <p>
        GovLink is a project of the <a href="https://ndstudio.gov" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Design Studio</a>
        at the General Services Administration, working with agencies across the federal government.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Open Source</h2>
      <p>
        Our code is open source. Contribute on <a href="https://github.com" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>